; ============================================================================
; x.1sav.dirent - what a card's directory records about one save
;
; An extension key for the Universal Saves Format, defined by these
; specifications under a name reserved in the Vendor Names registry because the
; value belongs to no single producer.
;
; The root here is the value carried under the key, not a bundle. A bundle
; validates against the format's own schema whatever this holds, since an
; extension value is `any` there; this file is what makes the shape checkable.
; ============================================================================

; Written as a choice rather than two optional keys so that an empty map is not
; a valid value: a producer with neither time omits the key instead.
dirent = {
    0 => entry-seconds,     ; created_at  - when the directory dates the entry
  ? 1 => entry-seconds,     ; modified_at - when the console last wrote it
} / {
    1 => entry-seconds,
}

; Whole seconds on the Unix scale, for the reason `created_at` gives in the
; format spec: tag 1 admits a float, and allowing it would give one instant two
; encodings. Directories count from wherever suits them, a GameCube entry from
; 2000-01-01 and a Saturn entry in minutes from 1980-01-01, and converting that
; once is the work this key exists to do.
entry-seconds = #6.1(int)
